#: ../../agents/antigravity.rst:239
msgid ""
"Run ``anet status`` in a terminal. ``[daemon_not_running]``: run ``anet "
"up``. ``anet`` not found: set ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` or ask the agent to run"
" the ``anet-setup`` skill. Then start a new session."
msgstr ""
"在终端运行 ``anet status``。``[daemon_not_running]``：运行 ``anet up``。找不到 "
"``anet``：设置 ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``，或请 agent 运行技能 ``anet-setup``。然后启动新会话。"

#: ../../agents/antigravity.rst:242
msgid ""
"The log of the MCP server says that ``node`` was not found, or that "
"``anet-mcp.cjs`` could not be started."
msgstr "MCP 服务器的日志表明找不到 ``node``，或无法启动 ``anet-mcp.cjs``。"

#: ../../agents/antigravity.rst:244
msgid ""
"Install the plugin again with ``agy plugin install`` and the directory of"
" the plugin, and start a new session."
msgstr "请用 ``agy plugin install`` 和插件目录重新安装插件，并启动新会话。"

